{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01Bv86Zr6jLSCmsXjr5cHdnr","type":"tool_result","content":"import re\n\n# Step 1: complaints about a bad/wrong exchange rate on a card payment or\n# cash withdrawal go to fees_fx, even when they read like a dispute.\n_RATE = re.compile(r\"\\b(exchange|conversion|fx)\\b|\\brates?\\b|\\bconver(t|ted|sion)\\b\", re.I)\n_WRONG = re.compile(\n    r\"\\b(wrong|incorrect|bad|poor|terrible|awful|off|unfair|less|lower|\"\n    r\"issue|problem|mistake|error|not right|didn'?t match|doesn'?t match)\\b\",\n    re.I,\n)\n\n\ndef route(text, laya_dept):\n    t = text or \"\"\n    if laya_dept == \"disputes\" and _RATE.search(t):\n        return \"fees_fx\"\n    # Cards can also catch \"card payment + wrong rate\"; require a complaint word.\n    if laya_dept == \"cards\" and _RATE.search(t) and _WRONG.search(t):\n        return \"fees_fx\"\n    return laya_dept\n----\ntext\tlaya_answer\tcorrect\nMy PIN was blocked.\taccount_security\tcards\nI must change my PIN as soon as possible.\taccount_security\tcards\nWhat is the procedure of unblocking my PIN?\taccount_security\tcards\nI entered in the wrong PIN.  Please help me unlock my account.\taccount_security\tcards\nWhere can I change my PIN?\taccount_security\tcards\nI think my pin has been compromised, what do I do?\taccount_security\tcards\nCan I change my pin through the app?\taccount_security\tcards\nIf I am not in the country and I need to change my PIN, how can this be done?\taccount_security\tcards\nI'm in Austria right now, but I really need to change my PIN right now. Can I do this even though I'm in another country?\taccount_security\tcards\nWhat are the steps to change my PIN to something else?\taccount_security\tcards\nWhere can I update my pin number?\taccount_security\tcards\nCan I unblock my PIN in the app?\taccount_security\tcards\nIf my PIN number is rejected, how do I solve it?\taccount_security\tcards\nMy PIN has been blocked.\taccount_security\tcards\nCan someone help me unblock my pin?\taccount_security\tcards\nCan I reset my PIN if it is blocked?\taccount_security\tcards\nHow much would an extra card cost?\tcards\tcards\nPlease provide me with the restrictions of the disposable cards.\tcards\tcards\nwhat is going on, i have entered my passcode and its not working\taccount_security\taccount_security\nI can't find my card, it is lost.\tcards\tcards\nI have a new card and need to activate it\tcards\tcards\nIs there a charge for sending out more cards?\tcards\tcards\nCan I make a contactless payments?\tcards\tcards\nHow do I add a card on to the app?\tcards\tcards\nWhy haven't I gotten my new card?\tcards\tcards\nPlease assist me in activating the card.\tcards\tcards\nHow do I link an existing card?\tcards\tcards\nI would like to link my card to my account.\tcards\tcards\nIt's been a week since you issued me a card and I still didn't get it. Should I keep waiting?\tcards\tcards\nPlease tell me, do you use Visa or Mastercard?\tcards\tcards\ncan I use my card before identity verification?\taccount_security\taccount_security\nHow do I use disposable cards?\tcards\tcards\n----\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"hook_started\",\"hook_id\":\"a71fc36d-75a4-4436-9b00-4716711f6dbc\",\"hook_name\":\"SessionStart:startup\",\"hook_event\":\"SessionStart\",\"uuid\":\"a4f6d54d-e822-4316-a829-faac9883bfa0\",\"session_id\":\"f44c3227-6a4e-4b9b-8bb7-f8e7be09b636\"}\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"hook_started\",\"hook_id\":\"0f3235e8-eebc-4059-b78f-40cd874e12ae\",\"hook_name\":\"SessionStart:startup\",\"hook_event\":\"SessionStart\",\"uuid\":\"4578fec8-0cde-4d09-9dd5-4fbb8ed52bab\",\"session_id\":\"f44c3227-6a4e-4b9b-8bb7-f8e7be09b636\"}\n{\"type\":\"system\",\"subtype\":\"hook_started\",\"hook_id\":\"0419ba07-ac52-42f9-8732-276984bac146\",\"hook_name\":\"SessionStart:startup\",\"hook_event\":\"SessionStart\",\"uuid\":\"8739bc8b-ec2d-44f6-b30c-781cd38e89a8\",\"session_id\":\"f44c3227-6a4e-4b9b-8bb7-f8e7be09b636\"}\n{\